# Module registration, source-info tables and settings defaults of both versions (S-038-R01..R06).
# A fresh module registers two sources with the same id: version 0 (flag OBSOLETE, 32 px default) and version 2.
load
info 1
info 2
defaults 1
defaults 2
# Unloading before any source was created does not touch FreeType (nothing was initialised).
unload
